体系+教育体系", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "与此同时，伴随这些产业结构的变迁，第二产业作为工业化的核心，大型企业和新兴产业作为增长的重要支撑，是需要外围企业和其他行业的支持的。", "range": "30049-30115", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "237554720_89VjJ0JZc", "userVid": 237554720, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781671061, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 237554720, "name": "Flaaaaaaaaash", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-NhbHkFzMelK60ty1tUcTH10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "So it goes", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "永远真实 保持热爱", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-1000", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "47499302_87wS2JdC0", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "制造业的中游，非常受其下游采购需求和上游材料价格影响", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "30098-30115", "abstract": "是需要外围企业和其他行业的支持的。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "47499302_87wS2JdC0", "userVid": 47499302, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773239266, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 47499302, "name": "L", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAybicP6njMScZJ2qzmliazzYtSZsKFGeo7ibq5zR1P8ic9EmwSVcicMOma7lVZTXIsMV6mmDA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "30349-30439", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "373155740_82ue1mkHK", "review": {"abstract": "工业化向消费阶段升级，生产者和消费者对服务业的需求是空前的。一是工业升级和深化，带来生产服务业（中间需求）的结构转变；二是城市化及消费结构变化带来消费服务业（最终需求）的结构转变。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "一是工业升级和深化会带来生产服务业的结构转变。生产服务业是为生产过程提供中间服务的行业，如研发设计、物流运输、金融服务等。工业升级意味着企业需要更专业、更高效的生产服务来提高竞争力，比如企业为了推出更具创新性的产品，会增加在研发设计方面的投入，这就促使生产服务业的结构从传统的基础服务向高端、专业化的服务转变。\n \n二是城市化及消费结构变化会带来消费服务业的结构转变。随着城市化水平提高，居民收入增加，消费结构也会发生变化，从满足基本生活需求转向追求更高品质的生活和精神消费。这会使得消费服务业的结构从传统的餐饮、零售等向文化、旅游、健康、教育等新兴消费领域转变。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "30349-30439", "createTime": 1755480927, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "373155740_82ue1mkHK", "userVid": 373155740, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 373155740, "name": "zzz", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIW0YMGLv1JtzxwqibXibJQj79kLicQoxwC0bibm3Lbb5WpFDMuOSxXeyGMhNsYtO9LVrr1iaib3T9oJzYRfUHfibtQ